==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|eɪtɪŋ}}

===Adjective===
'''grating'''

# (typically of a voice) [[harsh]] and [[unpleasant]]
# [[abrasive]]; tending to [[annoy]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[barrier]] that has [[parallel]] or [[crossed]] [[bar]]s blocking a passage but admitting air.
# A frame of iron bars to hold a fire.
# An [[optical]] [[system]] of close [[equidistant]] and [[parallel]] lines or bars, especially lines ruled on a polished surface, used for producing [[spectrum|spectra]] by [[diffraction]].
# {{context|nautical|in the plural|lang=en}} The strong wooden [[lattice]] used to cover a [[hatch]], admitting light and air; also, a movable lattice used for the flooring of boats.

